ffline businesses, hardware, biotech, or anyone looking for a business plan generator.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">Is the AI actually accurate?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\">It gives you a structured framework to evaluate your idea. It&#x27;s not perfect, but it&#x27;s better than asking your friends who will just say &quot;sounds cool!&quot;</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">Can I get a refund?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\">Yes, if you&#x27;re not satisfied with your Deep Report, contact us within 7 days for a full refund.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 text-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-lg bg-gray-900 px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white hover:bg-gray-800\" href=\"/idea/new\">Validate Your Idea Now</a></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t bg-gray-50\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-6 sm:flex-row\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ship h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 10.189V14\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M19 13V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6\"></path><path d=\"M19.38 20A11.6 11.6 0 0 0 21 14l-8.188-3.639a2 2 0 0 0-1.624 0L3 14a11.6 11.6 0 0 0 2.81 7.76\"></path><path d=\"M2 21c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1s1.2 1 2.5 1c2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-semibold\">ShipOrSkip</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Brutally validate your indie product idea before you waste weeks building it.</p><div class=\"flex gap-6\"><a class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900\" href=\"/pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"text-sm 